---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro'
import { seoResources } from '../../data/seoResources'
---
<Base title="Eye Care Practice Resources | Oculivo" description="Operational guides for optometry and ophthalmology practices covering software selection, patient recall, optical inventory, communications, insurance, scheduling and connected practice workflows.">
<main><section class="hero-dark page-hero"><div class="wrap"><span class="eyebrow">Oculivo resources</span><h1>Practical guides for connected eye-care operations.</h1><p>Deep-dive practice guides for the workflows that connect the front desk, clinical team, optical, billing and patient communication.</p></div></section>
<section class="section-light"><div class="wrap" style="padding-top:5rem;padding-bottom:5rem"><div class="depth-cards">
<article class="depth-card"><span class="num">01</span><h3><a href="/resources/best-optometry-software-guide/">How to Choose the Best Optometry Software</a></h3><p>Compare scheduling, clinical, optical, billing, communications, permissions, reporting and migration using a real patient journey.</p></article>
<article class="depth-card"><span class="num">02</span><h3><a href="/resources/best-ophthalmology-software-guide/">How to Choose the Best Ophthalmology Software</a></h3><p>Evaluate provider scheduling, referrals, documents, billing, communications, role access, reporting and migration.</p></article>
<article class="depth-card"><span class="num">03</span><h3><a href="/resources/cloud-based-optometry-software-guide/">Cloud-Based Optometry Software Guide</a></h3><p>Evaluate browser-based optometry software around scheduling, patients, optical operations, billing, communications, permissions and reporting.</p></article>
<article class="depth-card"><span class="num">04</span><h3><a href="/resources/ophthalmology-software-buyers-guide/">Ophthalmology Software Buyer’s Guide</a></h3><p>Compare cloud ophthalmology platforms using real provider, referral, document, billing and communication workflows.</p></article>
<article class="depth-card"><span class="num">05</span><h3><a href="/resources/optometry-patient-recall-workflow/">Optometry Patient Recall Workflow</a></h3><p>Build a repeatable process for due patients, outreach, booking and reactivation reporting.</p></article>
<article class="depth-card"><span class="num">06</span><h3><a href="/resources/optical-inventory-management-guide/">Optical Inventory Management Guide</a></h3><p>Connect frames, vendors, stock movement, patient orders and profitability.</p></article>
<article class="depth-card"><span class="num">07</span><h3><a href="/communications/">Patient Communications</a></h3><p>Keep calls, messages and reminders attached to the patient workflow.</p></article>
{seoResources.map((resource,index) => <article class="depth-card"><span class="num">{String(index+8).padStart(2,'0')}</span><h3><a href={`/resources/${resource.slug}/`}>{resource.title}</a></h3><p>{resource.description}</p></article>)}
</div></div></section></main></Base>